                                                "sense_id": "aaa39b2b-2bc6-3256-a609-c9c348cff471",
                                                "text": "Tom Fettig and his wife, Kim, were there with 60 yearlings, about half of a herd they were helping their son raise on the outskirts of Bismarck."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5d6674fe-8542-33d7-a159-f24c14c05ee0",
