                                                "sense_id": "4df8f4b2-43fd-36f0-9c96-32bbf485534b",
                                                "text": "\"But is a plebe forbidden to stroll here?\"\n\"If a plebe did have the brass to try it,\" replied Anstey slowly, \"I reckon he would have to fight the whole yearling class in turn.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1912ab5a-48ec-4814-b958-b0609c86060c",
                                                "sense_id": "4df8f4b2-43fd-36f0-9c96-32bbf485534b",
                                                "text": "As a yearling, he admitted to doing his part in ensuring that plebes knew their place at the Academy, […]"
                                            }
